  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat",
    "Add the curry paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly",
    "Add the smoked paprika and cook for another minute",
    "Add the vine tomatoes and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally",
    "Add the coconut milk, fish sauce, brown sugar, and salt, and stir to combine",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally",
    "Stir in the chopped basil and cook for an additional minute",
    "Remove from heat and let cool slightly before serving"
